@startuml
title Approve or reject an expense
actor "Demo reviewer" as User
participant Workspace as UI
participant "POST /api/changes" as Route
participant "Save handler" as Save
database SQLite as DB
User -> UI : Approve or reject a pending expense
UI -> Route : POST expense ID and decision
Route -> Save : Apply decision
Save -> DB : Update expense where status is pending
DB --> Save : Updated row count
alt One expense updated
  Save --> Route : Success
  Route --> UI : JSON success
  UI -> UI : Refresh queue and recalculate balances
else No pending expense matched
  Save --> Route : Already reviewed message
  Route --> UI : JSON error
end
@enduml
